  spellName: Repulsion Nova
  description: Everything within 3 units of you takes 0.6x weapon damage and is flung
    outward at force 12. Bodies flung into other bodies are hurt again by the collision
    (1% of max health per unit of closing speed above 3, up to 25%) and staggered;
    bodies flung into the wall slam and bounce. Clump them first and the second hit
    lands on all of them.
